## Usage hints: what a key does on the control that has the focus.
## JAWS's own words, with its capitals and periods: "Spacebar" in one hint, "spacebar" in another.

hint-activate-enter = To activate press Enter.
# A native button.
hint-activate-spacebar = To activate press spacebar.
hint-change-selection-arrows = To change the selection use the Arrow keys.
# A split button of Office's Quick Access Toolbar (Undo). JAWS's capitals [obs, 1051/s6].
hint-split-button = To move to an item, use the RIGHT ARROW, then use UP and DOWN ARROWS to select one.
hint-check-spacebar = To check press Spacebar.
hint-clear-checkmark-spacebar = To clear checkmark press Spacebar.
# The first item of a context menu. JAWS's capitals.
hint-context-menu-up-down = To navigate press Up or Down Arrow.
# A native menu button. JAWS ends it without a period.
hint-menu-button = Press space to activate the menu, then navigate with arrow keys
# The first item of a menu bar.
hint-menu-bar-left-right = To navigate press Left or Right Arrow.
# The first item of a page's menu bar.
hint-menu-bar-items-left-right = To move through items press left or right arrow.
# The first item of a menu.
hint-menu-items-up-down = To move through items press up or down arrow.
# The items of a list box, entered from outside it.
hint-move-to-an-item-arrows = To move to an item press the Arrow keys.
# A list view's items.
hint-move-to-items-arrows = To move to items use the Arrow keys.
# A radio button in a native dialog.
hint-radio-up-down = To change the selection press Up or Down Arrow.
# A combo box one can type into.
hint-set-value-arrows-or-type = To set the value use the Arrow keys or type the value.
hint-set-value-arrows = To set the value use the Arrow keys.
hint-slider-arrows = To increase or decrease use the Arrow keys.
# A tab of a native tab control.
hint-switch-pages = To switch pages, press Control+PageDown.
hint-toggle-spacebar = To toggle the state press spacebar.
# A native tree view's items.
hint-tree-arrows = To move through or expand items use the Arrow keys.
hint-type-in-text = Type in text.
# A read-only text field, as JAWS ends it [obs, 748/s17].
hint-read-only-text = Use your reading keys to read the text.
